# SHA-256 fingerprint of the certificate that signs every published Godbot APK
# (the release key; read from the published 0.1.22 APK). Android updates an
# installed app in place only with an APK signed by the same key, so a release
# build signed with anything else must never ship. scripts/release-apk.mjs checks
# every release build against this line.
9C:77:63:B0:7C:38:B2:CE:21:31:CF:54:7B:C1:01:76:1D:54:B3:6A:EF:7C:69:FB:0A:5C:BB:4A:63:09:61:98
